          "content": "Thomas Jefferson was born April 13, 1743, at Shadwell plantation in the Virginia Piedmont. Author of the Declaration of Independence, third President, founder of the University of Virginia, and lifelong slaveholder, Jefferson embodied the contradictions of the American founding. This lesson traces his formative years.",
