            "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"36\" fill=\"#ffd700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Corps Quiz</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#9ca3af\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Who led the Corps of Discovery</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"200\" width=\"900\" height=\"180\" fill=\"#10b981\" opacity=\"0.2\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"3\" rx=\"10\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"260\" font-size=\"28\" fill=\"#10b981\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Lewis and Clark</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"305\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Departed St. Louis May 14, 1804</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"345\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Returned September 1806</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"430\" width=\"900\" height=\"100\" fill=\"#6366f1\" opacity=\"0.2\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\" rx=\"10\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"470\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#6366f1\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Pike and Wilkinson</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"505\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Separate 1805-1807 southwest expedition</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"570\" width=\"900\" height=\"100\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" opacity=\"0.2\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"2\" rx=\"10\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"610\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Colter and Drouillard</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"645\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Corps members, not leaders</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"710\" width=\"900\" height=\"100\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" opacity=\"0.2\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\" rx=\"10\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"750\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Jackson and Burr</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"785\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Politicians not explorers in 1804</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"850\" width=\"900\" height=\"100\" fill=\"#ec4899\" opacity=\"0.2\" stroke=\"#ec4899\" stroke-width=\"2\" rx=\"10\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"890\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#ec4899\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Sacagawea Joined 1805</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"925\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Shoshone interpreter, infant in cradleboard</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"1010\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#9ca3af\" text-anchor=\"middle\">A trio whose names still echo in American memory</text></svg>",
            "caption": "Lewis and Clark led Jefferson's continental scientific mission."
